            ['text' => 'People think that intimacy is about sex. But intimacy is about truth. When you realize you can tell someone your truth, when you can show yourself to them, when you stand in front of them and their response is \'you\'re safe with me\'—that\'s intimacy.', 'author' => 'Taylor Jenkins Reid', 'category' => 'Hidden Feelings'],
            ['text' => 'He wore his pain like a secret, tucked deep beneath his ribs where no one would think to look.', 'author' => 'Atticus Poetry', 'category' => 'Hidden Feelings'],
            ['text' => 'The loudest hearts are often the quietest rooms.', 'author' => 'C. Churchill', 'category' => 'Hidden Feelings'],
            ['text' => 'You can close your eyes to the things you don\'t want to see, but you can\'t close your heart to the things you don\'t want to feel.', 'author' => 'Johnny Depp', 'category' => 'Hidden Feelings'],
            ['text' => 'I\'m a collection of dismantled almosts.', 'author' => 'Anne Sexton', 'category' => 'Hidden Feelings'],
            ['text' => 'It\'s hard to reveal your inner world, because when you do, you\'re not just showing people your garden—you\'re giving them a map to your graves.', 'author' => 'Iain Thomas', 'category' => 'Hidden Feelings'],
            ['text' => 'And then I realized that to be alone with your feelings is the only way to truly understand them. The world is loud, but your hidden feelings are the quietest, truest thing about you.', 'author' => 'Bianca Sparacino', 'category' => 'Hidden Feelings'],

            // Unspoken Words
            ['text' => 'The bitterest tears shed over graves are for words left unsaid and deeds left undone.', 'author' => 'Harriet Beecher Stowe', 'category' => 'Unspoken Words'],
            ['text' => 'Unspoken words between two people are like a wall slowly built of invisible bricks.', 'author' => 'Unknown', 'category' => 'Unspoken Words'],
            ['text' => 'The most important things are the hardest to say.', 'author' => 'Stephen King', 'category' => 'Unspoken Words'],
            ['text' => 'Sometimes the words we leave unspoken are the most important ones that should have been said.', 'author' => 'Meredith Grey (Grey\'s Anatomy)', 'category' => 'Unspoken Words'],
            ['text' => 'Silence is the most powerful scream.', 'author' => 'Anonymous', 'category' => 'Unspoken Words'],
            ['text' => 'We are masters of the unsaid words, but slaves of those we let slip out.', 'author' => 'Winston Churchill', 'category' => 'Unspoken Words'],
            ['text' => 'I have learned now that while those who speak about one\'s miseries usually hurt, those who keep silence hurt more.', 'author' => 'C.S. Lewis', 'category' => 'Unspoken Words'],
            ['text' => 'There are things known and there are things unknown, and in between are the doors of perception.', 'author' => 'Aldous Huxley', 'category' => 'Unspoken Words'],
            ['text' => 'The words you never spoke are louder than any noise you could have made.', 'author' => 'R.M. Drake', 'category' => 'Unspoken Words'],
            ['text' => 'What is left unsaid, remains unforgotten.', 'author' => 'Cassandra Clare', 'category' => 'Unspoken Words'],
            ['text' => 'Sometimes the most healing thing we can do is give voice to the silence we\'ve carried for too long.', 'author' => 'Brené Brown', 'category' => 'Unspoken Words'],
            ['text' => 'I am jealous of the words that rest on your tongue but never reach my ears.', 'author' => 'Christopher Poindexter', 'category' => 'Unspoken Words'],
            ['text' => 'The space between what you want to say and what you actually say is where the soul lives.', 'author' => 'Ocean Vuong', 'category' => 'Unspoken Words'],
            ['text' => 'Unspoken words are the most painful kind of goodbye.', 'author' => 'Unknown', 'category' => 'Unspoken Words'],
            ['text' => 'There is a voice that doesn\'t use words. Listen.', 'author' => 'Rumi', 'category' => 'Unspoken Words'],
            ['text' => 'I always had the words but never the courage. So they stayed inside me, building a home I could never leave.', 'author' => 'Sarah Kay', 'category' => 'Unspoken Words'],
            ['text' => 'The heaviest burdens in life are the thoughts we carry and never express.', 'author' => 'Ralph Waldo Emerson', 'category' => 'Unspoken Words'],
            ['text' => 'Words unsaid are like arrows stuck in the throat. They poison the blood and silence the soul.', 'author' => 'Unknown', 'category' => 'Unspoken Words'],
            ['text' => 'We swallow the words we most want to say, and choke on them in the dark.', 'author' => 'Atticus Poetry', 'category' => 'Unspoken Words'],
            ['text' => 'I write because I don\'t know what I think until I read what I say.', 'author' => 'Flannery O\'Connor', 'category' => 'Unspoken Words'],
            ['text' => 'The silence between two people who once had everything to say is the loudest sound in the world.', 'author' => 'Beau Taplin', 'category' => 'Unspoken Words'],
            ['text' => 'Sometimes not speaking says more than all the words in the world.', 'author' => 'Colleen Hoover', 'category' => 'Unspoken Words'],
            ['text' => 'All the words I never said are written in the spaces between the lines of my life.', 'author' => 'Unknown', 'category' => 'Unspoken Words'],
            ['text' => 'A closed mouth gathers no foot, but it also gathers no connection.', 'author' => 'Mark Twain (adapted)', 'category' => 'Unspoken Words'],
            ['text' => 'The greatest distance between two people is not misunderstanding. It is the words one was too afraid to say.', 'author' => 'S.Z.', 'category' => 'Unspoken Words'],
            ['text' => 'My tongue will tell the anger of my heart, or else my heart concealing it will break.', 'author' => 'William Shakespeare', 'category' => 'Unspoken Words'],
            ['text' => 'Unspoken expectations are premeditated resentments.', 'author' => 'Neil Strauss', 'category' => 'Unspoken Words'],
            ['text' => 'Some silences are answers. Some unspoken words are confessions.', 'author' => 'Unknown', 'category' => 'Unspoken Words'],
            ['text' => 'The cruelest thing you can do to another person is to take away their words. To make them feel that their voice does not matter. To let the unspoken pile up until they drown in it.', 'author' => 'Margaret Atwood (paraphrased sentiment)', 'category' => 'Unspoken Words'],
            ['text' => 'In the end, we will remember not the words of our enemies, but the silence of our friends.', 'author' => 'Martin Luther King Jr.', 'category' => 'Unspoken Words'],

            // Healing
