            ['text' => 'We think our job as humans is to avoid pain. Our job as parents is to protect our children from pain. But the truth is, our job is to navigate it. To survive it. To let it carve us into something deeper and more compassionate.', 'author' => 'Glennon Doyle', 'category' => 'Healing'],
